---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base
	title="Website Design"
	description="Xoaey Digital designs fast, conversion-focused, SEO-ready websites for small businesses — easy to update, no plugin treadmill."
>
	<section class="xd-hero">
		<div class="xd-container">
			<span class="xd-eyebrow">Service · Website design</span>
			<h1>
				Websites that <em>win customers</em>, not awards.
			</h1>
			<p class="xd-lede">
				A fast, clear website that tells visitors what you do, why to
				trust you, and what to do next — then gets out of the way. Built
				on modern tooling, easy for you to edit.
			</p>
			<div class="xd-btn-row">
				<a href="/contact" class="xd-btn">Request a quote</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="xd-section">
		<div class="xd-container">
			<span class="xd-eyebrow">What you get</span>
			<h2>Everything a small-business site needs. Nothing it doesn't.</h2>
			<div class="xd-grid-3">
				<div class="xd-card">
					<h3>Design that converts</h3>
					<p>
						Clear messaging, obvious next steps, and trust signals
						placed where visitors actually look — structured around
						your best enquiry source.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<h3>Speed as a feature</h3>
					<p>
						Static-first builds that load in a blink on phones and
						poor connections — better rankings, fewer bounces, more
						enquiries.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<h3>SEO-ready foundations</h3>
					<p>
						Sensible URLs, metadata, sitemaps, and local-business
						structured data from day one, editable in the CMS.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<h3>Easy to update</h3>
					<p>
						A friendly admin panel for text, images, and pages. If
						you can use email, you can update your site — with
						training videos included.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<h3>Accessible by default</h3>
					<p>
						Readable contrast, keyboard navigation, and semantic
						markup — so nobody is locked out of becoming your
						customer.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<h3>No plugin treadmill</h3>
					<p>
						No weekly update roulette or security-patch anxiety. Modern
						static builds with managed hosting that just stays up.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="xd-section xd-section-dark">
		<div class="xd-container">
			<span class="xd-eyebrow">Process</span>
			<h2>Live in weeks, not quarters.</h2>
			<div class="xd-grid-3">
				<div class="xd-card">
					<span class="xd-step-num">1</span>
					<h3>Shape</h3>
					<p>
						A working session on your offer, customers, and the one
						action the site must drive. Sitemap and homepage mockup
						for approval.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<span class="xd-step-num">2</span>
					<h3>Build</h3>
					<p>
						Design, copy polish, and development on a preview link
						you can share with anyone. Two revision rounds included.
					</p>
				</div>
				<div class="xd-card">
					<span class="xd-step-num">3</span>
					<h3>Launch &amp; care</h3>
					<p>
						We handle domain, hosting, and analytics setup, train
						you on the CMS, and offer a care plan for updates and
						small improvements.
					</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="xd-section">
		<div class="xd-container">
			<span class="xd-eyebrow">Questions</span>
			<h2>Website FAQ.</h2>
			<div class="xd-faq">
				<details>
					<summary>Can I update the site myself?</summary>
					<p>
						Yes — text, images, pages, and blog posts through a simple
						admin panel, with training included. Bigger changes are a
						quick email away on a care plan.
					</p>
				</details>
				<details>
					<summary>Will my site rank on Google?</summary>
					<p>
						We ship every technical SEO foundation and local-business
						markup. Rankings also need content and reviews — we'll
						tell you honestly what that takes for your market.
					</p>
				</details>
				<details>
					<summary>What about my existing site and domain?</summary>
					<p>
						We migrate your content, keep your domain and email
						untouched, and set up redirects so you don't lose existing
						rankings.
					</p>
				</details>
				<details>
					<summary>How much does a website cost?</summary>
					<p>
						Fixed quotes after a free discovery call. Most
						small-business sites land in a clear, published range —
						you'll know the price before we start.
					</p>
				</details>
			</div>
			<div class="xd-btn-row">
				<a href="/contact" class="xd-btn">Request a quote</a>
				<a
					href="/services/business-automations"
					class="xd-btn-ghost xd-btn"
				>
					See business automations
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>
</Base>
